\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rest of the weary,
\par Joy of the sad,
\par Hope of the dreary,
\par Light of the glad,
\par Home of the stranger,
\par Strength to the end,
\par Refuge from danger,
\par Saviour and Friend.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Pillow where, lying,
\par Love rests its head,
\par Peace of the dying,
\par Life of the dead,
\par Path of the lowly,
\par Prize at the end;
\par Breath of the holy,
\par Saviour and Friend.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. When my feet stumble,
\par I'll to Thee cry:
\par Crown of the humble,
\par Cross of the high,
\par When my steps wander,
\par Over me bend,
\par Truer and fonder,
\par Saviour and Friend.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Ever confessing
\par Thee, I will raise
\par Unto Thee blessing,
\par Glory and praise;
\par All my endeavour,
\par World without end,
\par Thine to be ever,
\par Saviour and Friend.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

